            "MILWAUKEE, WI — The American Corporation for Public Well Being today announced that its digital platform has served more than five billion requests since its relaunch in March 2026. The platform passed one billion pages served in July and served 1.95 billion requests in September alone. It now serves between 45 and 50 million requests on an ordinary day, and on October 2 set a new single-day record of 174.3 million.",
