            '"One in two hundred and seventy," said Dale Pettibone, ACPWB\'s Head of Non-Customer Relations. "These may be our human readers. They have not bought anything, signed anything or contacted us, which places every one of them in my portfolio. I would like them to know that we see them, approximately. Since March we have received 1,081 emails and replied to two, a ratio my department is working to improve. My door remains open. So far, everything that has come through it has been software."',
